uploads/
workflow_templates/

# Local-only design drafts (kept out of the tracked docs/ tree)
docs/ORI_MD_SPEC.md
docs/design/

# Misplaced generated protobuf files
github.com/


# Runtime project-templates library (materialized on startup; user data)
/templates/
# Test-run artifact: server builder tests materialize starters into the package dir
internal/server/templates/
